From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shphadnis <134159681+shphadnis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:48:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] spectro: add the Nutanix AHV provider (upstream backport)

Backports upstream's Nutanix provider from kubev2v/forklift main onto the
v2.12.10 fork, in upstream order:

- MTV-6194 Nutanix provider base and inventory (#7657)
- MTV-6234 Nutanix migrations (#8221)
- MTV-6664 Add Nutanix to providers detail list (#8408)
- MTV-6743 Improve Nutanix certificate handling (#8659)
- MTV-6881 Fix ACPI shutdown for Nutanix VMs (#8741)
- MTV-6979 Run v2v conversion for Nutanix VMs (#8428)
- MTV-7003 Nutanix upstream documentation (#8941)
- MTV-6999 Enable static IP feature for Nutanix provider (#8939)
- MTV-6980 Clean up Nutanix drivers after migration (#8940)

plus an ExcludedDisks stub on the Nutanix validator, which the fork's
validator interface requires and upstream's commits predate.
